*.pbxproj.backup

### Secrets ###
# Local build secrets (OpenAIP API key, etc.) — NEVER commit.
# Copy Secrets.example.xcconfig → Secrets.xcconfig and fill it in.
# Config.xcconfig (tracked) optionally #includes this file.
#
# SA-17: glob rather than the single literal filename. The canonical name was matched, but a
# duplicate of the kind Finder or a second scheme naturally produces — "Secrets copy.xcconfig",
# Secrets.local.xcconfig, Secrets.debug.xcconfig — was not, and would carry the real OpenAIP key.
Secrets*.xcconfig
!Secrets.example.xcconfig

# Signing / distribution material left behind after an archive. None of this belongs in the repo
# under any name. (SA-17)
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
ExportOptions.plist
.env
.env.*

# Large opaque reference blobs (Safari webarchives etc.) belong in the out-of-repo BUFFER/ area,
# not in a public repo. (SA-19)
*.webarchive
